5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us approach this game with a spirit of cooperation and kindness, for the truth often reveals itself to those who remain calm.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree. Since we have no information yet, we should use this time to observe each other's behavior and communication styles.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I will be observing from the sidelines for a while. It is better to listen first before making any hasty judgments.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,A logical start. I will be looking for contradictions in statements and analyzing how each person attempts to steer the conversation.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! I'll use my super-detective skills to find the wolf! Hehe, let's have fun everyone!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Enthusiasm is a wonderful thing, Sakura. It brings light to the group. I believe that by trusting one another, we can find a peaceful resolution.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Trust is important, but we must remember that the werewolf and the possessed will also try to appear trustworthy. We must remain vigilant.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,Minako is right. Experience has taught me that the most quiet waters often hide the deepest currents. I shall remain cautious.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, do you have a specific method for identifying the wolf, or are you simply advocating for general vigilance?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! Maybe the wolf is just someone who's acting too perfect? I'm going to watch everyone's faces really closely!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, perhaps the method is simply to listen to the heart. When someone speaks from a place of sincerity, it is often felt by others.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, I intend to track who agrees with whom too quickly. Mirroring is a common tactic for those trying to blend in.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,I find that approach sensible. I will be paying attention to those who try to lead the narrative too aggressively.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I see. I will focus on the logical gaps. If someone's story changes even slightly, that will be my primary lead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,Mirroring? That sounds like a magic trick! I'll try to be my usual silly self so the wolf can't copy me! Hehe!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a plan. Let us enter the first night with a peaceful mind. I wish you all a restful sleep.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. We will have more concrete information tomorrow once the Seer has their first result.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,I shall retire now. I look forward to seeing how the pieces fall into place tomorrow.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will be analyzing today's dialogue tonight. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
