36,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept well. The air feels heavy today; perhaps it is time for the Seer to guide us?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I have divined Servas. He is the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early. Are you certain, Minako, or is this a strategic move to eliminate a leader?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, revealing yourself as the Seer on day one is a high-risk strategy. Why choose to expose yourself immediately?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa! The Seer already found the wolf?! That was super fast! Is it really Servas? You look so nice, Servas!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I am deeply saddened that you would think such a thing of me, Minako. I only wish for the harmony of this group.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the risk is necessary. If we leave the werewolf active, we lose a member every night. It is more logical to act now.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,George,,"It is possible, but we must consider if the werewolf is claiming the Seer role to frame an innocent person.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, if you are the werewolf, you've just secured a target. If you are the Seer, you've given us the win. It is a binary gamble.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@George, you're being a bit grumpy! But Minako is always so calm, I think she's telling the truth! Right, Minako?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I accept your judgment if the group decides it, but I ask you to look into your hearts. Would I truly harm my friends?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@George, my conviction is firm. The divination does not lie. I suggest we vote for Servas now to end this.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,George,,"I am still skeptical of such a sudden reveal, but Minako's confidence is hard to ignore. I will consider it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we execute Servas and he is human, we lose the Seer and a villager. But if he is the wolf, the game ends. The probability favors the reveal.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm voting for Servas! Not because I don't like him, but because Minako said so and she's the smart one! Hehe!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,It seems my time here is short. I hope you all find peace and happiness in the days to come.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
